  "originalText": "[Code Name] Ch'en \n[Gender] Female \n[Combat Experience] 4 years \n[Place of Birth] Lungmen \n[Date of Birth] Jul. 7 \n[Race] Lung \n[Height] 168cm \n[Infection Status] \nUnknown.",
